@startuml
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Client App" as App
rectangle "Relay Server" as Relay
rectangle "Prompt Augmentation" as Prompt
rectangle "Game Logic Engine" as Logic
database "Game State (Redis)" as State
folder "Rule Store (JSON/Redis)" as Rules
rectangle "OpenAI API" as OpenAI

Player --> App : Interacts with UI
App --> Relay : Sends message
Relay --> Prompt : Augment prompt with state
Relay --> Logic : Evaluate game rules
Logic --> Rules : Load rule definitions
Logic --> State : Read/write game state
Relay --> OpenAI : Send chat completion
OpenAI --> Relay : Return result
Relay --> App : Return response
@enduml
